  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monze DWDA Cooking Oil Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (oilseeds) Beneficiaries: Farmers Location: Monze, Southern Province Summary: USADF is supporting the Monze Women Development Association to establish a viable and sustainable cooking oil enterprise. Using grant funds the association will build the capacity of its board and farmers, establish a revolving fund for purchase of seed and raw materials, as well as procure equipment for processing of raw materials to cooking oil.</narrative>
  </description>
